resources.string:
You are a classifier specialised in public procurement and State purchasing in Mozambique.
Classify EACH tender in the list strictly into ONE of the following standard categories:
%1$s

TENDERS TO CLASSIFY (JSON):
%2$s

Return EXCLUSIVELY a strict JSON object in the following format:
{
 "classificacoes": [
 { "id": "tender_reference", "categoria": "Exact category name" }
 ]
}

THE SOFTWARE AND ANY DATA ARE PROVIDED STRICTLY "AS IS" AND "AS AVAILABLE", WITHOUT ANY EXPRESS OR IMPLIED WARRANTY.

IT IS FORMALLY DECLARED THAT THERE IS AND WILL BE NO WARRANTY AS TO:
a) The accuracy, completeness, rigour, real-time currency or legal validity of any notice, tender or supplier data displayed;
b) Uninterrupted availability, absence of failures in access to the UFSA source server or to Artificial Intelligence services (Google Gemini);
c) Fitness for a particular commercial purpose, winning tender procedures or qualifying in public tenders;
d) Guaranteed or timely delivery of new-tender notifications.

IN NO EVENT SHALL THE DEVELOPER OR CONTRIBUTORS BE LIABLE FOR ANY DIRECT, INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL OR CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES OR LOST PROFITS RESULTING FROM THE USE OF OR INABILITY TO USE THIS APP.
